    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple fighting game. Each player gets <strong>1 - 5 randomly chosen attacks</strong> and fight on a <strong>randomly chosen map either 1v1 or with a team (depends on game settings)</strong>. The goal is to <strong>defeat your enemy</strong> with the attacks you were given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a few <strong>movement</strong> <strong>abilities</strong> such as a <strong>mid-air dive and a slide.</strong> Upon getting hit with an attack, if the blow was hard enough, the player will <strong>fall over</strong> and <i>cannot</i> use attacks until they stand back up.</p>",
